   225	(defn context
   226	  "The composition-owned context `verify` receives, from the session:
   227	   the subject, the principal of the composition's own key (nil without
   228	   one), and the session token.  Authorization vocabulary stays here and
   229	   in the policy; the question and the linker carry none."
   230	  [{:keys [key session]}]
