   337	   `{:node n :body b}`, `b` `::pending` with `:waits` the manifest whose
   338	   load the link waits on.  No record starts the load; a record of
   339	   another kind, whatever its status, is refused
   340	   `:dao.space.dht/kind-conflict` and left to its owner, neither
   341	   forgotten, waited on nor linked; `:loading` waits; `:failed` is
